    "result_text": "All green. \n\nThe change is implemented as small, cohesive units with minimal structural impact \u2014 no existing class was modified except a purely additive two-line wiring edit to the POST pipeline YAML:\n\n- **`EnsureOwnerEmailNotDisposable`** (new function, CC ~2, single method) \u2014 checks the owner's email domain against the blocklist `{mailinator.com, tempmail.com, guerrillamail.com}`; no email is accepted unchanged.\n- **`DisposableEmailException`** (new checked exception) and **`DisposableEmailExceptionHandler`** (new, responds 400 as a `ProblemDetail`), mirroring the existing `InvalidPostcode*` pattern.\n- **`DisposableEmailException.yml`** escalation mapping.\n- One additive edit to `owners.POST.yml` inserting the `ensureEmailNotDisposable` step right after `build` (so the built owner's mapped, lower-cased email is available).\n\nEach changed/added function has WMC_other of 0 (single-method classes) and low CC, so total structural cost stays small. Full suite: `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0` \u2014 BUILD SUCCESS.",
